1
00:00:00,006 --> 00:00:01,519
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,521 --> 00:00:03,021
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,194 --> 00:00:05,100
(Episode 85)

4
00:00:07,472 --> 00:00:08,537
Tell me.

5
00:00:08,607 --> 00:00:11,677
You got home late last night.
What happened in Seo Chon?

6
00:00:12,998 --> 00:00:13,998
Did you...

7
00:00:14,764 --> 00:00:16,843
lend Se Ri some money?

8
00:00:18,647 --> 00:00:20,079
- Well...
- I know Il Dong...

9
00:00:20,843 --> 00:00:23,581
isn't on a business trip.
He's in the hospital.

10
00:00:25,065 --> 00:00:26,879
He didn't tell me.

11
00:00:27,501 --> 00:00:29,634
Since he has no reason
to get involved in Se Ri's affairs,

12
00:00:30,172 --> 00:00:32,669
I figured you must have asked him to.

13
00:00:35,265 --> 00:00:37,808
Yes, that's right. Se Ri said
she was in a tight spot financially...

14
00:00:37,863 --> 00:00:40,028
and asked me to keep it confidential.

15
00:00:40,856 --> 00:00:42,131
Is something serious going on?

16
00:00:42,971 --> 00:00:44,872
She said it was a family matter
on your side.

17
00:00:46,952 --> 00:00:48,150
You know...

18
00:00:48,865 --> 00:00:51,350
one of Seung Woo's legs
is prosthetic, right?

19
00:00:52,945 --> 00:00:56,190
He had an accident while following
Min Ki's car, which Se Ri was driving.

20
00:00:56,912 --> 00:00:58,324
For over 20 years after that,

21
00:00:58,702 --> 00:01:00,956
we searched for the hit-and-run driver.

22
00:01:01,445 --> 00:01:04,730
But it turned out Se Ri knew him.

23
00:01:05,125 --> 00:01:08,286
In fact, she'd been paying him.

24
00:01:09,265 --> 00:01:11,620
And you lent her that money.

25
00:01:12,972 --> 00:01:15,470
I heard she borrowed from loan sharks
to keep her business running.

26
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,356
That was a lie.

27
00:01:17,645 --> 00:01:20,807
No, she had been lying...

28
00:01:20,928 --> 00:01:22,457
ever since my son had the accident.

29
00:01:22,685 --> 00:01:26,511
My son ran into Se Ri's car and fell.
That was what caused the accident.

30
00:01:27,217 --> 00:01:28,953
But she hid that from us.

31
00:01:29,765 --> 00:01:30,765
I suspect...

32
00:01:31,762 --> 00:01:35,311
the hit-and-run driver found out
and used it to blackmail her.

33
00:01:37,191 --> 00:01:39,543
She wanted Ji Ni to have older brothers,

34
00:01:41,455 --> 00:01:43,109
but she was only thinking
of herself again.

35
00:01:44,652 --> 00:01:46,470
I'm telling you because I'm afraid...

36
00:01:46,472 --> 00:01:48,631
you might not know
what's going on and help her again.

37
00:01:49,038 --> 00:01:51,821
And right now...

38
00:01:52,494 --> 00:01:54,594
I can't bear to look at Ji Ni.

39
00:01:55,318 --> 00:01:57,960
I'd like to stay in Seo Chon for a while.

40
00:01:58,312 --> 00:02:01,104
My children are all deeply shaken too.

41
00:02:02,258 --> 00:02:03,916
Does Ji Ni know?

42
00:02:05,585 --> 00:02:07,004
I don't care.

43
00:02:07,892 --> 00:02:11,616
I know she's different from her mom,

44
00:02:13,073 --> 00:02:16,365
but I don't have the emotional strength
to consider that right now.

45
00:02:17,401 --> 00:02:20,582
I can't be at ease around her like before.

46
00:02:21,886 --> 00:02:23,050
I understand.

47
00:02:25,192 --> 00:02:26,627
I'm sorry, Joong Bin.

48
00:02:42,338 --> 00:02:43,338
What?

49
00:02:43,585 --> 00:02:45,173
Il Dong isn't on a business trip.

50
00:02:45,252 --> 00:02:46,667
He's in the hospital.

51
00:02:47,312 --> 00:02:49,372
I'll call you later.
Let's go see him together.

52
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:50,975
Why?

53
00:02:51,063 --> 00:02:52,556
What's wrong with him?

54
00:02:52,558 --> 00:02:54,725
He's not sick. He got hurt.

55
00:02:55,018 --> 00:02:57,280
He's recovering well, so don't worry.

56
00:02:58,593 --> 00:03:01,154
There's just something going on.

57
00:03:01,415 --> 00:03:02,488
I'll explain later.

58
00:03:11,725 --> 00:03:13,287
Don't contact my mom.

59
00:03:13,375 --> 00:03:15,299
And don't help her. I'll handle it.

60
00:03:16,365 --> 00:03:17,687
How can you handle it alone?

61
00:03:17,858 --> 00:03:20,181
I'll decide whether to cut her off
or help her.

62
00:03:20,525 --> 00:03:21,859
Just pretend you don't know.

63
00:03:24,652 --> 00:03:26,341
Whether we sink or swim together,

64
00:03:26,622 --> 00:03:28,963
this is a punishment
Mom and I have to bear.

65
00:03:31,918 --> 00:03:33,985
I don't want to drag you into this.

66
00:03:35,742 --> 00:03:36,771
Are you upset?

67
00:03:38,541 --> 00:03:39,684
Honestly, a little.

68
00:03:41,018 --> 00:03:42,561
Aren't we supposed to be a team?

69
00:03:42,931 --> 00:03:44,004
Why are you shutting me out?

70
00:03:44,725 --> 00:03:47,126
You went alone in the middle of the night,
then asked why I came.

71
00:03:47,892 --> 00:03:49,481
Shouldn't I have gone with you?

72
00:03:50,774 --> 00:03:53,434
I'm sorry. I didn't have the energy
to think about that too.

73
00:03:53,605 --> 00:03:55,412
Don't think of this as your problem alone.

74
00:03:55,618 --> 00:03:56,698
We're married now.

75
00:03:57,177 --> 00:03:58,177
I know.

76
00:03:58,618 --> 00:04:01,084
I'll try. I'm sorry.

77
00:04:02,445 --> 00:04:06,382
"Why was I born? I shouldn't have been."
Are you thinking that way again?

78
00:04:06,416 --> 00:04:07,697
You saw what happened.

79
00:04:08,212 --> 00:04:10,587
None of this would've happened
if I hadn't been born.

80
00:04:10,589 --> 00:04:11,831
Ji Ni.

81
00:04:14,278 --> 00:04:15,388
Okay.

82
00:04:15,670 --> 00:04:18,372
I'll try to work through this with you.

83
00:04:18,555 --> 00:04:19,716
I'll try.

84
00:04:21,491 --> 00:04:23,422
I put your mom up in a small motel.

85
00:04:24,392 --> 00:04:26,867
It was pretty run-down,
so I suggested moving her somewhere nicer,

86
00:04:27,235 --> 00:04:28,346
but she refused.

87
00:04:29,112 --> 00:04:30,302
I feel bad.

88
00:04:31,332 --> 00:04:33,203
Who do you think feels good right now?

89
00:04:33,278 --> 00:04:35,913
Mom should be the one feeling the worst.

90
00:04:37,812 --> 00:04:40,503
If you're going to take my mom's side,
don't say a word to me.

91
00:04:40,992 --> 00:04:42,618
I can't take that too.

92
00:04:56,418 --> 00:04:57,628
How is Aunt?

93
00:04:58,531 --> 00:04:59,815
She's going to Seo Chon.

94
00:05:00,038 --> 00:05:01,195
To avoid Ji Ni?

95
00:05:01,778 --> 00:05:03,827
We need to watch what we say.

96
00:05:04,157 --> 00:05:05,157
Okay?

97
00:05:05,398 --> 00:05:06,494
We're walking on thin ice.

98
00:05:20,412 --> 00:05:21,412
Yes.

99
00:05:27,285 --> 00:05:28,443
Aunt.

100
00:05:29,634 --> 00:05:32,135
It got pretty heated yesterday. I'm sorry.

101
00:05:32,333 --> 00:05:33,454
It's okay.

102
00:05:35,538 --> 00:05:38,625
What my mother-in-law did was truly wrong.

103
00:05:39,432 --> 00:05:42,693
But Ji Ni really had no idea.

104
00:05:43,212 --> 00:05:44,605
She's suffering so much right now.

105
00:05:48,211 --> 00:05:50,951
So what do you expect me to do?

106
00:05:52,085 --> 00:05:54,337
I just feel bad.

107
00:05:57,158 --> 00:05:58,158
I'm sorry.

108
00:05:59,544 --> 00:06:02,073
No matter how many times
I hear "I'm sorry,"

109
00:06:02,720 --> 00:06:04,306
it won't fix anything, Ji Hu.

110
00:06:04,818 --> 00:06:05,818
I'm sorry.

111
00:06:06,492 --> 00:06:07,492
Okay.

112
00:06:08,412 --> 00:06:09,801
I don't know what else to say.

113
00:06:10,535 --> 00:06:11,535
That's enough.

114
00:06:12,432 --> 00:06:14,060
You take care of Ji Ni.

115
00:06:14,278 --> 00:06:15,948
I'll take care of myself and my children.

116
00:06:37,652 --> 00:06:39,128
See you later, Yeong Ju.

117
00:06:49,527 --> 00:06:50,527
Ji Ni.

118
00:06:52,152 --> 00:06:54,560
Why didn't you say goodbye to your aunt?

119
00:06:55,425 --> 00:06:56,425
Sa Bin,

120
00:06:56,994 --> 00:06:59,650
why is she leaving so soon
after coming home late last night?

121
00:06:59,731 --> 00:07:01,294
And without even telling me?

122
00:07:03,676 --> 00:07:04,962
She told me.

123
00:07:06,613 --> 00:07:09,221
What about me? Am I invisible?

124
00:07:09,536 --> 00:07:10,684
Are you leaving me out?

125
00:07:10,686 --> 00:07:12,494
Who's leaving you out?

126
00:07:12,495 --> 00:07:13,750
You are!

127
00:07:13,778 --> 00:07:16,510
You never tell me anything!

128
00:07:16,789 --> 00:07:17,789
I'm sorry.

129
00:07:18,427 --> 00:07:19,889
I'm sorry, Sun Kyung.

130
00:07:20,272 --> 00:07:22,022
Let's all go eat.

131
00:07:33,585 --> 00:07:36,108
Mother, make sure you eat properly.

132
00:07:36,336 --> 00:07:37,530
I'll come by after work.

133
00:07:37,835 --> 00:07:38,835
(Mother)

134
00:07:41,112 --> 00:07:42,362
Are you awake?

135
00:07:44,295 --> 00:07:45,544
How's Ji Ni?

136
00:07:45,622 --> 00:07:47,174
She's fine. Don't worry.

137
00:07:47,296 --> 00:07:48,296
Good.

138
00:07:48,525 --> 00:07:50,322
I'm glad she has you by her side.

139
00:07:51,216 --> 00:07:52,288
Yes, Mother.

140
00:07:52,745 --> 00:07:54,945
We're most worried about your health.

141
00:07:55,372 --> 00:07:56,520
Thanks.

142
00:07:56,746 --> 00:07:57,746
Ji Hu,

143
00:07:58,296 --> 00:08:02,308
don't look down on her just because things
have turned out this way.

144
00:08:03,018 --> 00:08:04,307
She has no dad,

145
00:08:04,607 --> 00:08:07,960
and the brothers I worked so hard
to give her may all be taken away,

146
00:08:08,276 --> 00:08:09,659
but she still has me.

147
00:08:09,971 --> 00:08:11,660
Don't ever look down on her.

148
00:08:12,355 --> 00:08:13,355
Of course not.

149
00:08:14,218 --> 00:08:16,160
She means everything to me.

150
00:08:17,047 --> 00:08:18,194
Okay. That's all.

151
00:08:25,211 --> 00:08:26,367
Is something going on at home?

152
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:29,044
- You startled me.
- What's going on?

153
00:08:29,592 --> 00:08:30,769
Can't you tell me?

154
00:08:30,771 --> 00:08:33,154
Why not? You're my friend.

155
00:08:34,331 --> 00:08:35,798
But I can't tell you right now.

156
00:08:36,311 --> 00:08:38,881
It's about Ji Ni,
so I'll tell you when she's ready.

157
00:08:39,461 --> 00:08:40,626
Thanks for your concern.

158
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:46,803
Yes, I'm coming down now.

159
00:08:48,068 --> 00:08:49,068
Sir.

160
00:08:49,178 --> 00:08:51,811
Jung A just got out of a taxi.
She has a lot to carry and needs help.

161
00:08:51,813 --> 00:08:52,813
I'll go help her.

162
00:08:54,471 --> 00:08:55,532
Jung A's here? Why?

163
00:08:56,439 --> 00:08:57,439
Jung A?

164
00:08:57,871 --> 00:08:59,127
Right.

165
00:08:59,218 --> 00:09:01,746
We held an art contest
for teenagers, remember?

166
00:09:02,018 --> 00:09:03,707
The students from Jung A's art academy
entered too,

167
00:09:03,754 --> 00:09:05,293
and she was supposed
to bring their drawings today.

168
00:09:05,325 --> 00:09:08,082
You mean the illustrations
for the teen poetry collection?

169
00:09:08,841 --> 00:09:09,922
Hello.

170
00:09:10,310 --> 00:09:11,534
That's a lot!

171
00:09:13,692 --> 00:09:16,866
I brought some from other academies,
not just mine.

172
00:09:17,212 --> 00:09:19,811
Once they heard there was prize money,
the kids went all out.

173
00:09:20,865 --> 00:09:23,737
They were burned out from preparing
for art school, so this was a nice break.

174
00:09:23,852 --> 00:09:26,214
By the way, why did you contact Ji Sung
instead of me?

175
00:09:26,794 --> 00:09:28,116
Are you upset with me?

176
00:09:28,259 --> 00:09:29,408
No, I'm not.

177
00:09:29,539 --> 00:09:31,164
Come on. You are.

178
00:09:31,978 --> 00:09:35,051
Anyway, these drawings here
are from my academy.

179
00:09:35,385 --> 00:09:37,384
Please take a good look at them, okay?

180
00:09:38,485 --> 00:09:40,643
- Are you leaving already?
- Yes, I'm a little busy.

181
00:09:40,764 --> 00:09:41,764
I'll give you a ride.

182
00:09:43,152 --> 00:09:45,579
This is okay, right?
I'm not overstepping, am I?

183
00:09:45,581 --> 00:09:47,345
You're still holding a grudge.

184
00:09:48,225 --> 00:09:49,763
- Where are you going?
- Jong No Bookstore.

185
00:09:49,765 --> 00:09:50,897
I have a meeting
with the person in charge.

186
00:09:51,695 --> 00:09:52,695
Let's go.

187
00:09:53,096 --> 00:09:54,791
I'll bring afternoon snacks
when I come back.

188
00:09:54,793 --> 00:09:55,831
- Okay. See you later.
- Bye.

189
00:09:55,833 --> 00:09:57,037
Take care.

190
00:10:00,472 --> 00:10:03,375
By the way, you look really tired.

191
00:10:03,590 --> 00:10:04,767
I'm fine.

192
00:10:06,652 --> 00:10:08,173
I heard Tae O said something to you.

193
00:10:08,304 --> 00:10:11,131
Exactly! It's so unfair. I'm furious.

194
00:10:12,185 --> 00:10:14,343
Did I bother you too
at your mom's birthday party?

195
00:10:14,345 --> 00:10:16,473
No, I liked having you there.
You're naturally cheerful.

196
00:10:16,851 --> 00:10:18,359
You really brighten up the place.

197
00:10:18,935 --> 00:10:19,935
Right?

198
00:10:20,056 --> 00:10:21,371
I knew you'd be on my side.

199
00:10:23,107 --> 00:10:25,919
Still, I should avoid doing things
that could be misunderstood.

200
00:10:25,932 --> 00:10:27,734
I don't think Ji Ni likes it much either.

201
00:10:28,121 --> 00:10:30,520
- Really?
- She hasn't even contacted me lately.

202
00:10:32,327 --> 00:10:35,459
That's just because Ji Ni's going through
a lot. Don't take it personally.

203
00:10:36,069 --> 00:10:38,226
What's wrong with Ji Ni? What's going on?

204
00:10:38,251 --> 00:10:39,251
I'll tell you later.

205
00:10:40,332 --> 00:10:43,005
I'm glad Ji Ni has a cheerful friend
like you by her side.

206
00:10:50,158 --> 00:10:51,273
Ma'am.

207
00:10:51,850 --> 00:10:52,905
Hey, Jung A.

208
00:10:53,030 --> 00:10:54,839
- Hello.
- My future daughter-in-law is here!

209
00:10:55,094 --> 00:10:56,449
Really?

210
00:10:57,074 --> 00:10:58,293
She seems so sweet and polite, right?

211
00:11:03,738 --> 00:11:04,918
Jung A, have some tea.

212
00:11:07,485 --> 00:11:10,349
I really don't think
you should be doing this.

213
00:11:11,538 --> 00:11:13,648
I'm Ji Ni's friend, after all.

214
00:11:14,115 --> 00:11:18,129
It makes me uncomfortable
to hear you say things like this to me.

215
00:11:18,598 --> 00:11:21,138
You insult Ji Ni
by calling her the daughter of a mistress,

216
00:11:21,252 --> 00:11:23,746
and now you're asking me
to become a mistress myself?

217
00:11:25,605 --> 00:11:27,914
Didn't you say you liked Ji Hu?

218
00:11:29,246 --> 00:11:30,335
Well...

219
00:11:31,810 --> 00:11:33,444
I did like him,

220
00:11:33,658 --> 00:11:36,190
but he's married. I even gave
a congratulatory speech at their wedding.

221
00:11:36,192 --> 00:11:37,884
I don't acknowledge that marriage.

222
00:11:38,483 --> 00:11:40,181
Ji Ni's mom also gave...

223
00:11:40,434 --> 00:11:43,034
a congratulatory performance
before stealing someone's husband.

224
00:11:43,805 --> 00:11:45,242
She's getting what she deserves.

225
00:11:46,072 --> 00:11:47,288
Ma'am.

226
00:11:47,782 --> 00:11:49,521
Why should I be the one to punish her?

227
00:11:49,722 --> 00:11:50,854
I don't want to.

228
00:11:53,718 --> 00:11:54,932
Just answer one question.

229
00:11:56,438 --> 00:11:59,409
Do you not want to be my daughter-in-law?
Do you dislike Ji Hu?

230
00:11:59,712 --> 00:12:02,064
If things could go exactly the way
you wanted, what would you do?

231
00:12:03,558 --> 00:12:04,732
Would you agree to be my daughter-in-law?

232
00:12:06,072 --> 00:12:07,964
What if Ji Ni weren't around?

233
00:12:09,399 --> 00:12:10,399
What if?

234
00:12:10,464 --> 00:12:13,271
Of course. It's purely hypothetical.
One hundred percent.

235
00:12:16,405 --> 00:12:18,132
Ji Hu only likes Ji Ni.

236
00:12:20,631 --> 00:12:21,824
You're so naive.

237
00:12:22,144 --> 00:12:24,310
Do you really think there's such a thing
as eternal love?

238
00:12:25,578 --> 00:12:26,578
Fine.

239
00:12:26,771 --> 00:12:30,418
I understand how you feel, so from now on,
just follow my lead.

240
00:12:30,492 --> 00:12:31,948
I'll take care of everything.

241
00:12:32,472 --> 00:12:34,856
- Ma'am.
- Isn't falling out with one friend...

242
00:12:35,043 --> 00:12:36,785
just something that happens in life?

243
00:12:37,212 --> 00:12:38,751
It's not like
you're betraying your country.

244
00:12:39,285 --> 00:12:41,796
All you have to do
is cut Ji Ni out of your life.

245
00:12:43,446 --> 00:12:45,835
Understood?

246
00:12:52,978 --> 00:12:56,499
Please, just tell me
which room Il Dong is in.

247
00:12:57,271 --> 00:12:59,121
I don't think you should go.

248
00:13:00,698 --> 00:13:02,796
Yeong Ju will have a hard time
seeing you right now.

249
00:13:02,798 --> 00:13:05,406
I'll make sure I don't run into her.

250
00:13:06,585 --> 00:13:08,594
I heard he was stabbed because of Mom.

251
00:13:08,889 --> 00:13:10,569
How can I just pretend I don't know?

252
00:13:13,996 --> 00:13:15,155
What's wrong?

253
00:13:16,350 --> 00:13:19,031
It breaks my heart to see you like this.

254
00:13:21,042 --> 00:13:23,618
It's okay.
I have to bear the consequences.

255
00:13:24,218 --> 00:13:26,432
And I just want to make something clear,
just in case you were thinking about it.

256
00:13:27,364 --> 00:13:30,234
Please don't pity my mom or help her.

257
00:13:31,445 --> 00:13:33,884
Mom and I deserve to be punished.

258
00:13:33,885 --> 00:13:36,729
Why should you?
You don't deserve to be punished.

259
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:39,055
Because I'm her daughter.

260
00:13:39,818 --> 00:13:41,844
This all happened because I was born.

261
00:14:00,791 --> 00:14:02,505
Then you shouldn't have had me.

262
00:14:02,507 --> 00:14:04,274
You shouldn't have loved Dad.

263
00:14:04,952 --> 00:14:06,927
If you keep building my life
on other people's suffering,

264
00:14:06,929 --> 00:14:08,849
how can I hold my head up?

265
00:14:08,851 --> 00:14:11,325
Because I didn't want you to find out,
you little brat!

266
00:14:11,972 --> 00:14:14,958
I didn't care if anyone else found out,
but I couldn't let you know.

267
00:14:16,130 --> 00:14:17,485
Mom, seriously...

268
00:14:20,338 --> 00:14:22,517
You can't hide something this big.

269
00:14:28,265 --> 00:14:30,064
If you can hide it, then you should.

270
00:14:30,965 --> 00:14:32,777
If you can hold on, then you should.

271
00:14:33,192 --> 00:14:35,656
Who would turn themselves in
just to admit they screwed up?

272
00:14:49,958 --> 00:14:50,991
Hey, it's me.

273
00:14:50,993 --> 00:14:52,870
Where are you? Why aren't you here yet?

274
00:14:53,942 --> 00:14:54,942
What?

275
00:14:54,944 --> 00:14:56,996
Do I have something scheduled today?

276
00:14:56,998 --> 00:14:59,411
You're supposed to try on outfits
for the photo shoot.

277
00:15:00,355 --> 00:15:04,398
Right. I'll be there soon. Wait for me.

278
00:15:06,480 --> 00:15:08,480
Seriously...

279
00:15:26,578 --> 00:15:27,578
Honey.

280
00:15:28,517 --> 00:15:32,153
Still, I shouldn't leave my dear Ji Ni
with any debts to pay.

281
00:15:33,298 --> 00:15:34,687
My poor girl.

282
00:15:52,725 --> 00:15:53,725
Go.

283
00:15:55,645 --> 00:15:58,423
They call you that crazy woman's daughter.
You sure have some nerve.

284
00:15:58,778 --> 00:16:00,312
What did you expect to hear
by coming here?

285
00:16:00,692 --> 00:16:01,692
I...

286
00:16:02,637 --> 00:16:06,111
was against you marrying Ji Hu, too.

287
00:16:06,593 --> 00:16:07,593
Yes.

288
00:16:07,932 --> 00:16:10,052
Just stay out of sight and live quietly.

289
00:16:11,058 --> 00:16:13,147
And don't bring any more shame
on the General's family.

290
00:16:14,345 --> 00:16:16,215
That's all I have to say.

291
00:16:18,139 --> 00:16:19,810
- Do you feel wronged?
- No.

292
00:16:21,283 --> 00:16:22,406
I'm sorry.

293
00:16:23,085 --> 00:16:24,728
That's why I came here.

294
00:16:24,845 --> 00:16:26,150
I have no other motive.

295
00:16:27,311 --> 00:16:30,551
If you're truly sorry, get divorced
and leave the General's house.

296
00:16:32,458 --> 00:16:35,180
I can't stand seeing someone like you
living with your head held high.

297
00:16:35,890 --> 00:16:38,392
Ji Hu is far too good for you.

298
00:16:42,165 --> 00:16:44,613
- Honey!
- Why did you come?

299
00:16:55,626 --> 00:16:59,091
Why's everyone rushing over?
I'm telling you, I'm fine.

300
00:16:59,158 --> 00:17:01,280
You're always going on about Na Se Ri,

301
00:17:01,282 --> 00:17:03,105
and you got stabbed protecting her?

302
00:17:03,512 --> 00:17:05,016
And you didn't even tell me?

303
00:17:05,652 --> 00:17:07,452
Are you only the General's man?

304
00:17:07,454 --> 00:17:09,605
Aren't you my husband too?

305
00:17:10,871 --> 00:17:13,203
I told you to be more careful!

306
00:17:13,611 --> 00:17:18,631
Okay. Did I scare you? I'm sorry.

307
00:17:31,685 --> 00:17:33,140
She said she was sorry.

308
00:17:34,359 --> 00:17:36,224
She came to apologize on her mom's behalf.

309
00:17:37,638 --> 00:17:39,014
Where is Na Se Ri now?

310
00:17:39,055 --> 00:17:40,159
I kicked her out.

311
00:17:40,745 --> 00:17:43,532
I don't care what happens to her anymore.

312
00:17:43,533 --> 00:17:45,137
How can you not care?

313
00:17:45,732 --> 00:17:47,940
Once I get out of here, I'll kill her.

314
00:17:48,225 --> 00:17:51,084
I'll kill that snake, Lee Cheol,
right alongside her,

315
00:17:51,085 --> 00:17:52,307
just so you all know.

316
00:17:53,411 --> 00:17:54,411
You can live on your own, right?

317
00:17:54,498 --> 00:17:56,318
What a thing to say.

318
00:17:56,558 --> 00:17:58,401
Can your General cover that up too?

319
00:17:58,557 --> 00:17:59,601
Enough.

320
00:18:00,438 --> 00:18:01,521
My dear nephews,

321
00:18:01,544 --> 00:18:03,816
I'll handle this myself, so don't worry.

322
00:18:03,958 --> 00:18:05,205
Don't get your hands dirty.

323
00:18:06,672 --> 00:18:11,251
I've always regretted not killing
your dad. Let me make up for that now.

324
00:18:13,338 --> 00:18:15,192
You're a father too.

325
00:18:15,319 --> 00:18:16,951
I'm begging you.

326
00:18:18,005 --> 00:18:20,104
Let the law handle it.
Why do you always...

327
00:18:20,106 --> 00:18:21,791
have to throw punches first?

328
00:18:30,012 --> 00:18:31,341
He's been in a daze since yesterday.

329
00:18:31,955 --> 00:18:33,152
Of course he has.

330
00:18:33,978 --> 00:18:35,247
I'll see what's going on.

331
00:18:35,885 --> 00:18:37,202
- Help him up.
- Okay.

332
00:18:37,204 --> 00:18:40,095
We should clean up. The smell is awful.

333
00:18:42,196 --> 00:18:43,343
Be careful.

334
00:19:55,058 --> 00:19:56,874
Please tell me where he is.

335
00:19:58,457 --> 00:19:59,962
I told you to leave it to me.

336
00:20:00,105 --> 00:20:01,628
Stay out of it. It's dangerous.

337
00:20:01,712 --> 00:20:04,147
You know how long I've tried to find him.

338
00:20:04,945 --> 00:20:07,957
That girl wanted to know earlier,
so I gave her his location.

339
00:20:08,185 --> 00:20:10,985
Let them kill each other.
You stay out of it.

340
00:20:11,105 --> 00:20:13,218
You gave his location to Ji Ni?

341
00:20:13,378 --> 00:20:14,507
You said she could fight, didn't you?

342
00:20:14,508 --> 00:20:16,505
No! I have to deal with him myself.

343
00:20:17,252 --> 00:20:19,598
- I've searched so long for him.
- I know.

344
00:20:19,645 --> 00:20:22,685
I know, but don't do it yourself.

345
00:20:23,018 --> 00:20:24,912
- Think about your mom.
- Uncle.

346
00:20:24,978 --> 00:20:26,914
Let them pay for what they've done.

347
00:20:28,257 --> 00:20:29,880
Isn't it perfect?

348
00:20:30,218 --> 00:20:33,412
No matter which one dies,
we don't lose a thing.

349
00:20:33,438 --> 00:20:36,353
Could there be a better way
to get revenge on Na Se Ri?

350
00:20:38,065 --> 00:20:40,814
That girl dies,
and Lee Cheol goes to prison.

351
00:20:41,565 --> 00:20:42,858
It couldn't be better.

352
00:20:43,691 --> 00:20:45,293
Keep your hands clean.

353
00:20:59,801 --> 00:21:02,260
(Cha Seung Woo)

354
00:21:12,152 --> 00:21:13,152
What do you think?

355
00:21:13,807 --> 00:21:15,415
Isn't my idea brilliant?

356
00:21:15,685 --> 00:21:18,239
Seung Woo, keep an eye on your brother.

357
00:21:18,332 --> 00:21:20,240
Don't let him get dragged into this.

358
00:21:20,258 --> 00:21:21,548
That guy is dangerous.

359
00:21:23,725 --> 00:21:25,703
He pulled a knife right away.

360
00:21:25,825 --> 00:21:27,636
That bastard's done this before.

361
00:21:28,365 --> 00:21:30,221
We can't leave Ji Ni to face him alone.

362
00:21:30,438 --> 00:21:32,922
We'll go. Tell us where he is, Uncle.

363
00:21:32,923 --> 00:21:34,488
You little brats.

364
00:21:35,078 --> 00:21:36,836
Has living together made you care for her?

365
00:21:36,838 --> 00:21:38,917
- Because she's in the Cha family?
- That's not it.

366
00:21:39,192 --> 00:21:41,328
I just want to deal with him myself.

367
00:21:41,502 --> 00:21:43,910
- Please tell me.
- Listen to me.

368
00:21:44,597 --> 00:21:46,575
Get your revenge without lifting a finger.

369
00:21:49,531 --> 00:21:50,531
Hey.

370
00:21:51,298 --> 00:21:52,418
Hey, you.

371
00:21:53,710 --> 00:21:54,710
Hey!

372
00:21:55,907 --> 00:21:57,365
Hey, let go!

373
00:21:57,552 --> 00:22:01,198
If you two get hurt,
your mom will kill me!

374
00:22:04,439 --> 00:22:05,439
(Lee Cheol)

375
00:22:05,441 --> 00:22:06,618
You're pretty strong.

376
00:22:11,285 --> 00:22:13,773
- You damn brats!
- Stay here.

377
00:22:13,943 --> 00:22:14,943
I'm going.

378
00:22:15,751 --> 00:22:17,483
Seung Hyun!

379
00:22:17,485 --> 00:22:19,331
Hey, stop him.

380
00:22:19,465 --> 00:22:21,318
Seung Hyun can't handle that guy alone.

381
00:22:21,338 --> 00:22:22,677
Hurry up and stop him!

382
00:22:23,696 --> 00:22:24,776
Okay.

383
00:22:24,778 --> 00:22:26,098
Seriously!

384
00:22:38,664 --> 00:22:40,602
(Cha Seung Woo)

385
00:22:58,458 --> 00:23:00,828
- Seung Hyun.
- I told you not to follow me!

386
00:23:01,592 --> 00:23:03,558
Stay here. I'll call if I need you.

387
00:23:04,265 --> 00:23:05,503
Ji Ni isn't answering.

388
00:23:05,505 --> 00:23:06,837
Don't talk about that girl.

389
00:23:10,911 --> 00:23:12,505
Seung Hyun, let me come with you.

390
00:23:17,512 --> 00:23:18,585
Na Ji Ni!

391
00:23:22,558 --> 00:23:24,010
Why aren't you answering your phone?

392
00:23:24,074 --> 00:23:25,815
Why are you here? It's dangerous.

393
00:23:25,816 --> 00:23:26,816
You should leave.

394
00:23:27,008 --> 00:23:28,342
Don't do anything dangerous.

395
00:23:28,578 --> 00:23:30,070
You can't handle that guy.

396
00:23:30,364 --> 00:23:31,478
It's okay.

397
00:23:31,605 --> 00:23:33,505
I have to pay for what I've done.

398
00:23:35,412 --> 00:23:36,891
I don't need your atonement. Just go.

399
00:23:36,893 --> 00:23:38,023
Back then...

400
00:23:39,360 --> 00:23:41,855
I was taking pictures when you got hurt.

401
00:23:42,878 --> 00:23:44,935
My mom saw it and pretended she didn't.

402
00:23:46,091 --> 00:23:47,799
My mom and I can never be forgiven.

403
00:23:48,507 --> 00:23:49,600
I'm sorry.

404
00:23:50,285 --> 00:23:51,889
I don't mind dying here.

405
00:23:52,116 --> 00:23:53,165
Don't be ridiculous.

406
00:23:54,485 --> 00:23:57,036
Stay alive and spend your life
making up for it.

407
00:23:57,165 --> 00:23:58,591
If I survive, I will.

408
00:23:59,357 --> 00:24:01,625
Please just go!

409
00:24:02,171 --> 00:24:04,305
Will your death fix my leg?

410
00:24:04,352 --> 00:24:05,814
Please stay outside.

411
00:24:07,235 --> 00:24:08,235
Hey!

412
00:24:48,105 --> 00:24:49,238
Give me your leg!

413
00:24:49,524 --> 00:24:51,014
Hold on.

414
00:24:51,135 --> 00:24:53,339
So your own leg matters, huh?

415
00:24:54,025 --> 00:24:55,631
You didn't care when you wrecked his.

416
00:24:56,198 --> 00:24:58,225
I'm sorry. I know I was wrong.

417
00:24:58,227 --> 00:24:59,649
You shattered my brother's leg...

418
00:25:00,137 --> 00:25:02,244
and left him on the road.
He was just a child!

419
00:25:02,878 --> 00:25:03,878
Sorry?

420
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:06,784
- After all this time?
- I was wrong. Please spare me!

421
00:25:06,950 --> 00:25:08,125
You should've turned yourself in.

422
00:25:08,691 --> 00:25:10,498
Even if you ran away,
you should've come back!

423
00:25:10,499 --> 00:25:12,412
I couldn't turn myself in!

424
00:25:12,414 --> 00:25:13,414
Why not?

425
00:25:14,194 --> 00:25:15,999
Give me your leg, you bastard!

426
00:25:16,001 --> 00:25:17,532
I was told not to come back.

427
00:25:18,811 --> 00:25:20,618
Na Se Ri told me to!

428
00:25:24,274 --> 00:25:26,487
She gave my parents money...

429
00:25:26,788 --> 00:25:28,392
and told us to leave the neighborhood.

430
00:25:30,158 --> 00:25:33,398
She said not to turn myself in
or ever get caught.

431
00:25:35,305 --> 00:25:38,281
She wanted the injured boy's mom
and grandpa to suffer forever.

432
00:25:38,682 --> 00:25:40,058
She said she wanted revenge.

433
00:25:40,245 --> 00:25:42,454
Stop making things up, you bastard!

434
00:25:42,509 --> 00:25:43,509
I'm not.

435
00:25:44,882 --> 00:25:46,570
Her mom told me to do it!

436
00:25:46,778 --> 00:25:48,323
That's why she gave me money so easily.

437
00:25:49,038 --> 00:25:51,311
She was terrified I'd tell you this.

438
00:25:52,479 --> 00:25:53,479
I swear.

439
00:25:54,026 --> 00:25:55,641
She told us to run away...

440
00:25:55,696 --> 00:25:58,611
and ruined our family's
Chinese restaurant in the neighborhood!

441
00:25:59,772 --> 00:26:01,388
My dad said she forced us into hiding.

442
00:26:01,555 --> 00:26:03,407
He complained about it every day.

443
00:26:04,641 --> 00:26:05,641
That's a lie.

444
00:26:06,378 --> 00:26:09,635
She couldn't have gone that far...

445
00:26:10,378 --> 00:26:12,558
Your mom made me a criminal!

446
00:26:13,618 --> 00:26:15,322
She's the one you should get revenge on.

447
00:26:15,691 --> 00:26:17,485
All I did wrong was take the money.

448
00:26:17,752 --> 00:26:19,912
Both my parents died because of her!

449
00:26:19,914 --> 00:26:21,252
You're still the one who ran.

450
00:26:21,745 --> 00:26:23,592
Seung Woo, call the police.

451
00:26:23,918 --> 00:26:26,352
Tell them exactly what happened.

452
00:26:26,758 --> 00:26:27,968
Including him stabbing Uncle!

453
00:26:28,160 --> 00:26:29,160
Okay.

454
00:26:29,535 --> 00:26:31,578
No!

455
00:26:31,838 --> 00:26:32,838
Don't call the police!

456
00:26:41,110 --> 00:26:43,110
Seung Hyun, it's gasoline!

457
00:26:50,025 --> 00:26:51,935
Seung Woo, get her out of here!

458
00:26:52,092 --> 00:26:53,542
- Call the police right now!
- Okay.

459
00:27:06,718 --> 00:27:07,969
Ji Ni!

460
00:27:08,790 --> 00:27:09,790
Ji Ni?

461
00:27:11,053 --> 00:27:12,053
Are you hurt?

462
00:27:14,045 --> 00:27:15,348
I didn't mean to stab her.

463
00:27:15,613 --> 00:27:17,793
I didn't mean it!

464
00:27:18,948 --> 00:27:20,679
Get out!

465
00:27:22,140 --> 00:27:23,140
Get out! Hurry!

466
00:27:30,432 --> 00:27:32,432
Hurry! Get out!

467
00:27:32,691 --> 00:27:34,364
Get out of here! Hurry!

468
00:27:35,067 --> 00:27:38,375
- Come out!
- I can't!

469
00:27:38,376 --> 00:27:39,742
Seung Hyun! Help!

470
00:27:39,776 --> 00:27:40,776
We need to help her!

471
00:27:44,598 --> 00:27:45,598
Hurry! Come out!

472
00:27:45,922 --> 00:27:48,833
- Come out!
- Ji Ni!

473
00:27:55,645 --> 00:27:57,084
- Seung Woo, help!
- Okay.

474
00:28:00,831 --> 00:28:01,896
Seung Hyun!

475
00:28:02,693 --> 00:28:03,693
Don't!

476
00:28:55,239 --> 00:28:58,618
(Family Register)

477
00:28:58,787 --> 00:29:01,611
We were informed that an unidentified body
was found at the scene.

478
00:29:01,612 --> 00:29:03,209
Did you take Ji Ni there on purpose?

479
00:29:03,211 --> 00:29:04,431
This is all your fault.

480
00:29:04,433 --> 00:29:06,425
- She was pregnant?
- My poor friend.

481
00:29:06,427 --> 00:29:09,032
You'll have to step in
and save Ji Hu and Ji Ni, won't you?

482
00:29:09,034 --> 00:29:10,569
Save Ji Ni?

483
00:29:10,570 --> 00:29:12,416
Lawyer's fees? The gold is gone.

484
00:29:12,417 --> 00:29:13,680
The wedding gift? That 100,000 dollars?

485
00:29:13,681 --> 00:29:15,416
Did you steal to pay for her wedding?

486
00:29:15,418 --> 00:29:17,672
That gold isn't yours! It's mine!

487
00:29:19,668 --> 00:29:21,668
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
